# Paths no tool should crawl or index. This is the .ignore convention that
# ripgrep honours by default, and that several editors and coding agents read.
# It mirrors the ignore list in AGENTS.md and the build-output rules in
# .gitignore: vendored libraries under .pio/ are the expensive one.
.pio/
.venv/
.backup/
.shots/
.dummy/
compile_commands.json
